      "text": "内十八格 - 乙巳鼠贵格",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c105:p0002",
      "sha256": "7c27e62664aee56e2458e985bd66c6fec52769c1497f6cd7a53f35001c594055"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-乙巳鼠贵格",
      "text": "此格如月内有官星则不用之，大怕午字冲之。丙子时，丙字为妙，谓之聚贵也。或曰：柱中有庚字、辛字，并申字、酉字、丑字内有庚辛金则减分数，岁君大运亦然。又曰：四柱中原无官星，方用此格。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c105:p0003",
      "sha256": "bcf1e610fc674de3bbdd1b82b6d5dd09dc89b5ec78cc70475eadd556546af43a"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-乙巳鼠贵格",
      "text": "袁判院，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c105:p0004",
      "sha256": "1b0445f283c3f9baea63efdfbd86bde353ef94b17edb7b6fb5537bbd69ebf5d0"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-乙巳鼠贵格",
      "text": "甲寅 戊辰 乙亥 丙子，贵人",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c105:p0005",
      "sha256": "8734959d48f1e66dce84cc3c3aec603b91c658d627020a8eed471cffddd249e2"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-乙巳鼠贵格",
      "text": "车御带，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c105:p0006",
      "sha256": "17f136b9d2c8c8d2e037b504ee3574a99f299b476bbfe384a17ef094051bb03a"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-乙巳鼠贵格",
      "text": "戊子 癸亥 乙未 丙子，贵人",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c105:p0007",
      "sha256": "5112b067b25a16f3f8e2dd820012f6a3b7b28fda48622139662accf24b328532"
    },
    {
      "section": "内十八格-乙巳鼠贵格",
      "text": "眉批：诗诀，阴木天干丙午时，乙巳要贵富为奇，无冲官杀方为美，年少声名达凤池。以日干为主，取贵在时。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
